      "content": "This is a critical fairness challenge that requires careful feature engineering and model auditing. To mitigate bias, focus on *structural* indicators of stability—like local investment indices or public resource availability—rather than demographic proxies. Furthermore, you must rigorously test your model using disparate impact analysis across protected groups to ensure performance parity before deployment. Finally, using anonymized, aggregated data helps prevent specific geographic profiling while retaining valuable contextual signals.",
